    "Do not hardcode FIREBURN duration into either polymorphic elemental-trap template.",
    "Do not make a preference-only punctuation or radius wording edit to the accepted 范围 %d rendering.",
    "No claim that Orcs source is commit-pinned; only its inspected file hash is matched.",
    "No claim that the incoming total guarantees an unchanged standalone per-turn schedule after BURNING merge or downstream mitigation."
  ]
